;; cohost carve exceptions — every var below is kept with its
;; reaching mechanism as the reason. Carve analyzes src/ alone;
;; cohost is a library whose surface is reached by NAME (the
;; rewrite, the boot installer, adapter registries, downstream
;; repos), so a src-only static pass cannot see the uses.
;; Census 962 -> 956 at the S7 tip; zero vars deleted as dead:
;; the only private findings were the two :jank-arm vars in
;; group 1, proven used below.

